{
  "title": "Quick Energizing Ethiopian Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A buttery and pillowy Ethiopian dish featuring dasima-kombu, perfect for a quick and energizing meal. This halal-friendly recipe is made with tender lamb and aromatic spices.",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
  "diet": [],
